{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51456","headline":"寄旧友西乾耕隐童先辈 · 李频","name":"寄旧友西乾耕隐童先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种竹参差长，栽松次第成。\n戎衣遍江汉，未厌子真耕。\n（《四部业刊三编》影明抄本《梨岳诗集·辑补》（原注：「右见徐璈刊本。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}